WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:02.980
It's like a dream come true!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.830
Gin-san buying a pair of glasses for me...

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.430
I'll think of these glasses 
as you and never let them go!

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.310
I'll treasure them forever!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.870
I heard that you're not getting 
any assassination work.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.650
Only makes sense after all the mistakes,

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.250
and you even injured your own men.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.210
They'll be coming for you.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.580
The Assassins of Assassins Squad!

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.590
The Lethal Punishers!

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.970
I'm sorry...

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.920
They were a present from Gin-san...

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:41.270
I promised to treasure them...

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.530
You don't need to see a thing right now.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.620
Don't need to see a thing.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.650
When you wake up,

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.400
there won't be any cracks in your vision.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:55.180
The Assassins of Assassins 
of Assassins Squad!

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.050
Lethal Odd Jobs is moving out!

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.410
<i>Is everybody in position?</i>

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:01.250
<i>Roger.</i>

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.970
You all went to Don Quijote!

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.000
Don Quijote...

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:50.630
<i>This sensation...</i>

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.540
<i>Someone's here...</i>

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.520
<i>two on the roof,</i>

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.650
<i>one inside,</i>

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.030
<i>and one in the yard...</i>

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:04.440
I can smell multiple humans.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.440
As expected.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.860
But it doesn't matter how many there are.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:12.200
This time, we'll finish her off

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.700
along with the others.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.450
Th-They're here...

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.960
<i>The hell are they doing?!</i>

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.210
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.590
<i>Hurry back!</i>

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:36.930
<b>Glasses Prevent You From 
Seeing Certain Things</b>

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.810
Do you read me? Do you read me?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.440
Five suspicious figures on the premises.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.400
The Punishers have come!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.590
Get your asses back here!

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.690
Sarutobi's completely helpless right now!

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.440
I can't hold them off for long!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:49.750
I repeat!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.940
Get back to the house!

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.950
Sarutobi's going to die, over!

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.160
What?

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.750
Gin-san, he said that the Punishers 
are already there, over.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.590
<i>Hold on.</i>

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.550
<i>They have the enema type,</i>

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.460
<i>but they're out of the suppository, over.</i>

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.220
No, it's not for me!

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.220
<i>Forget about that already, over!</i>

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:07.410
Eh? You're the one who 
told me to buy some, over.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.140
<i>The situation has changed!</i>

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.440
<i>This isn't the time to be 
worrying about my anus, over!</i>

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:12.400
Screw that!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.360
I'm buying your damn Preparation H!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.470
Get your hemorrhoids ready, over!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:17.880
<i>It won't be my ass that's 
bleeding all over the place!</i>

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.350
<i>I said to forget about it, over!</i>

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:23.890
Zenzo-san, I sent Kagura-chan 
and Sadaharu back first.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.530
We'll be right behind them, 
so you'll have to make

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.360
do with wet wipes in the meantime, over!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.490
Damn...

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.440
My plan has been ruined by these fools.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:33.930
Do you read me?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.030
Zenzo here.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.120
Where are you, China girl? Over.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.610
<i>Who's there?!</i>

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:42.640
<i>Who are...</i>

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.940
Hey, what's wrong?!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.330
Did something happe--

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.560
It can't be...

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.050
China girl!

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:52.740
<i>Are... Are...</i>

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.470
<i>Are you using SECOM?</i>

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.640
What kind of dream is that?!

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:01.150
Why do you sound like a commercial 
for a private security company?!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.660
And why are you asleep again?

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.140
Why did you come back then, dammit?!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.270
It's too late for us kiddies 
and doggies to be up...

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.190
Don't fall asleep!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.030
Wake up!

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:14.380
Do you want to die with Sarutobi?!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.270
Fine, fine.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.180
I get it.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:22.290
I'll keep my eyes open and stand watch.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.180
You think you can fool me with that?!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.080
Why are you sleeping next to Sarutobi?!

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:28.960
Idiot!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.790
I'll have to go wake her up.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:41.930
Punisher No. 1

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.340
Pillow Masa.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.950
He makes sure that his target's slumber

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.080
is permanent by swapping 
the target's pillow for one

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.980
that has a bomb in the blink of an eye.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.690
An assassin who goes after 
targets when they're asleep.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.410
H-Here he comes...

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.270
At the worst possible time!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.780
A-A bomb!

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.420
Hey! Wake up!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.030
Run away!

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:02.720
<i>A bomb...</i>

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:03.600
Shut up!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.680
What?!

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:05.870
Are you an idiot?!

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.210
This isn't the time to be sleeping!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.290
Wake up!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:09.790
Hmph.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.800
Good night, ladies.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.350
I-It's so heavy!

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.410
The pillow won't budge!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.660
What's wrong with this girl?!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.680
It's like her head is made out of lead!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.430
He insists on killing people by swapping

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:31.940
out their pillows?

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.230
Don't take me lightly!

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:40.950
I've disposed of many traitors 
by swapping their pillows!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.510
I won't let this little girl...

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.450
Won't let this little girl...!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.120
Got it!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.250
How sleepy can you be?!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.630
Let go of your damn pillow!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.630
There!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.630
Yes, that's more like it.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.820
Now, ladies,

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.640
good night.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:05.640
This is bad!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:08.770
Huh?

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.720
I use SECOM...

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.690
Hey!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.150
How can your sleeping be so violent?!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.840
<i>Do you read me?</i>

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.110
<i>Shimura here.</i>

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:36.490
<i>I just heard an explosion in the yard.</i>

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:37.600
<i>Is everything okay?</i>

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.630
<i>Over!</i>

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:40.450
Well, I'm not sure what just happened,

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.470
but one of them was taken out.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.470
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.650
There are still four left.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:46.270
I'll move Sarutobi. We can meet somewhere else.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:46.970
Where are you?

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.300
<i>We already came back,</i>

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.130
<i>but I got separated from Gin-san.</i>

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.480
<i>I'm trying to find everyone 
from a high place.</i>

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.090
High place?!

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:55.840
You idiot!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:58.040
The enemy's gonna spot you!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.440
<i>What am I supposed to do then?</i>

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:00.880
<i>There we go!</i>

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.490
<i>I can see you!</i>

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.490
I'm up here!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.950
Man, it's so hot.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.500
I bought a few t-shirts.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.910
Would you like to change into one?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:11.780
Behind you!

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.820
Behind you, Shimura!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.710
Wh-Who are you?!

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:32.560
<b>Punisher No. 2</b>

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.110
T-Shirt Tatsu.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.760
An assassin who specializes in t-shirts.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.410
He makes sure that his target 
is permanently too tight

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.460
by swapping the target's 
medium-sized t-shirt for his own

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.490
small-sized t-shirt in the blink of an eye.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.940
What the hell is an assassin 
who specializes in t-shirts?!

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.940
<b>He is very proud of his t-shirts</b>

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.830
You're not even an assassin!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:32.980
<b>and is a big fan of artistic t-shirts.</b>

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.980
You're just an old man in a t-shirt!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:34.040
Strip.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.480
Shut up and strip!

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.840
Wait! Let me go!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.980
Hey, there's something wrong with this image!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.080
It's creeping me out!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.050
The hell are you people doing?!

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:43.940
Who cares about a t-shirt?!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:44.800
It's so heavy!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.110
I can't take off his t-shirt!

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:50.240
Is this a large instead of a medium?!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.370
Is there really that much of a difference?!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.900
Don't take me lightly!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.950
I've put on many tight t-shirts

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.880
by taking off such loose t-shirts!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.580
I won't let this large-sized t-shirt...

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.560
Won't let this large-sized t-shirt...!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.390
Got it!

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.520
He was wearing a small t-shirt to begin with!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.020
Who gives a damn?!

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:14.930
Well, Gin-san took the medium one.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:16.520
Sorry about this.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:19.290
No, I should be the one to apologize.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.910
You should have told me that 
you were wearing a small.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:22.480
What's going on?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.550
Why are small ones acceptable?

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:25.550
What do you have against medium t-shirts?!

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.820
Actually, I have a bunch 
of small t-shirts here.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:29.980
You can have them if you'd like.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.530
What? I can try them on?

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.030
What are you doing?! Do your job!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.250
Aren't you a Punisher?!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.460
Did you come here to try on t-shirts?!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.560
Whee! T-shirts are meant to be small!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.500
It feels so good to have the cloth 
pulled tightly across your skin!

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.010
Huh? This shirt is bigger than I expected.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.550
Oh, there weren't any mediums, but 
there was a large one in there.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.680
That's okay though, right?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.190
You tricked me!

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.660
Why?!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.690
Why would he die because 
he put on a large t-shirt?!

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.690
What's the story here?!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.230
I feel kinda bad.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.450
But now, there are only three left.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.080
Three?

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.900
Did this guy even count?

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.240
<i>Sakata here.</i>

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:20.940
<i>I just heard a small-sized t-shirt 
being ripped apart in the yard.</i>

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.090
<i>Is everything okay? Over.</i>

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.720
How could you hear that?!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.100
Is everything okay with your ears?!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.070
Oh, there you are.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.850
Gin-san, where'd you go?

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.090
I was worried.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.410
Well, it's so hot.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:34.760
So I was digging through the 
fridge for something cold.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:35.850
I found some Chuuberts.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.770
Don't you people have any sense of danger?!

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.430
Why are you changing into t-shirts 
and looking around for snacks

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:43.180
while assassins are running around?!

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:44.730
And those Chuuberts are mine!

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.300
Don't be stupid!

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.880
I risked my life to grab these

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.160
Chuuberts while assassins are running around!

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:50.740
They're mine!

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:53.000
I was saving those for later!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.340
I'm never gonna let you have the grape one!

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.730
Now, now.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.580
There's a grape and a soda,

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:00.710
so let's be nice and share.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.350
Why are you back awake like 
nothing ever happened?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.340
How did a Chuubert wake up someone

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.340
who was knocked out by an explosion?!

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.340
If we break them in half, we'll have four.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.530
I want soda.

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.020
I want grape.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.470
I'll take soda then.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.750
See? It worked out perfectly.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.860
G-Grape...

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.730
She seems to be having a nightmare.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.780
Let's break them in half then.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.140
Grape!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.910
That's my choice...

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.500
Hey!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.970
Why are you making requests while

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.350
pretending to have a nightmare?!

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.670
Grape, my ass!

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:44.350
Whose fault do you think this mess is?

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.220
Gin-san!  You shouldn't do 
that to someone who's injured!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.820
She's obviously awake!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.550
She's only pretending to be asleep!

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:50.830
Not much we can do.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.810
I guess the grape people will 
have to do rock, paper, scissors

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.290
with the loser getting the knobs on the end.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.020
Don't be ridiculous!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.650
The soda people should join in then!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.310
I'd rather have a soda than the knobs!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.530
No way!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.580
This is a problem for the grape people!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.390
Don't drag the soda people into this!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.510
Right, Pachi-boy?

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.820
I'm fine with grape or soda.

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:11.310
Th-Then Pachi-boy gets left out...

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.290
How can you say such terrible things while

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.550
having a nightmare, Sa-chan-san?!

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.780
Gin-san! She's obviously awake!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.160
Then the loser gets both the knobs.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:20.710
Okay!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.550
First comes rock!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.470
Rock, paper...

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.550
Huh? Hold on.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:25.290
Uh...

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.800
Don't these Chuuberts look a little strange?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:29.980
How?

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.800
Now that you mention it, 
they seem a little clean.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:33.800
Huh?

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.300
They don't have any knobs?

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.020
Ah...

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.150
<b>Punishers No. 3, 4
Assassins who specialize in Chuuberts. They make sure that their target is permanently suffering from a brother complex</b>

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.860
The Chuubert Chu Brothers!

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:49.080
Refer to the caption for the 
rest of our introduction!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:51.150
<b>by swapping the longer part of the Chuubert for the shorter part in the blink of the eye. Incidentally, the brothers split their own Chuuberts vertically.</b>

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.150
Don't bother coming up with an intro 
if you're too lazy to give it!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.130
How unfortunate!

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:59.160
We switched the longer parts 
for the shorter parts!

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.160
The shorter end is perfect for you fools!

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:03.530
You get to experience the anguish

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.670
felt by a younger brother when relinquishing

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:07.670
the longer part to your older brother!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.670
Even though you aren't little brothers!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.810
Brother, it worked perfectly!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.800
The souls of our comrades will rest easy now!

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.840
Let us return home and celebrate 
with the longer parts of Chuuberts!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.460
This BGM is...

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.190
There are others who are 
able to use this BGM?!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.920
Brother!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.100
Th-There are Chuuberts...!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.690
Chuuberts in our asses!

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:39.230
Y-You bastards!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.750
Give back...

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.080
...the longer Chuubert parts.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:45.200
S-Spare us!

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.610
We already ate them!

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.080
Stupid brother!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.500
H-Hold on!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:50.370
We'll buy new ones for you!

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.510
Promise!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.880
Please spare our lives!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.070
Please! We'll buy as many as you want!

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.090
How many longer parts do you want?

00:13:57.420 --> 00:14:01.280
Wait! Wait!

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:24.600
Yo.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:25.910
Sorry to keep you waiting, boss.

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:28.920
We punished your Punishers.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.420
Four weak-ass Punishers.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.920
They need a special crash 
course on the art of killing.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.420
Work 'em to the bone.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.380
Take this message to your superiors.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.710
If they want to crush Sa-chan the Assassin,

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.930
they better send every killer they got.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.420
Don't worry.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.430
I already let them know.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:04.300
I knew that killing the top assassin

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.950
in Edo wouldn't be easy.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:10.460
I-I was just kidding, boss!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.270
Give me a break!

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.170
It was just a joke!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.710
A little killer of a joke!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.970
You don't have to be so serious!

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.480
Okay, there you have it!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.480
Everybody's dismissed!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.240
Good work!

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:25.780
Sorry about the mix-up!

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:27.550
Uh, are you listening?

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:28.880
Really, I'm sorry!

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.970
I'm apologizing!

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.070
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.430
This is all because you got too cocky!

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:38.810
That's because I thought it was 
safe to start playing it cool!

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.900
Don't give me that shit!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.350
I was coerced into helping these people!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:43.750
Keep them and let me go!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.710
Bring it on!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:50.570
If Gin-chan dies, his 
soul will live on in us!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.570
Why are you making it sound like 
I'm the only one who's gonna die?!

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.010
You can live on inside me!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.880
Ayame Sarutobi, you have good friends.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.150
We aren't friends!

00:15:59.150 --> 00:15:59.840
We're total strangers!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.260
We have nothing to do with her!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:05.330
But your crime was to 
succumb to your weakness.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.260
We don't need weak assassins.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.350
I have cut down many evil villains with

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:13.900
this very blade to protect 
Edo from the shadows.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.550
I cannot allow my blade to falter

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.400
for the sake of one weakling.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.910
If you need something to blame, 
blame your own weakness.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:26.910
And your failure to protect 
your own comrades!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.910
Gin-san!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.420
What?!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.510
The bells of Jetavana toll,

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.430
echoing the impermanence of all things.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:47.430
The color of the flowers on the sal tree...

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:53.560
Only the evil practice certain death.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:58.400
I won't let you lay a finger on these people.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.190
Or I'm not Sa-chan the Assassin.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.690
Sa-chan-san!

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:07.160
So you've returned from the 
depths of hell, Ayame Sarutobi.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.830
I was ready to grant you

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:11.660
a peaceful crossing of the River Styx.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.380
You intend to resist us 
in your current state?

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.930
I'm sure that you've already seen

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.340
how you stand no chance against us.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:24.310
I wouldn't know,

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:27.410
since I have poor eyesight.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:29.850
But...

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.410
I can see clearly now.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:33.600
How I was a fool.

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.350
How kind everyone has been.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.300
How Zenzo's hemorrhoids are getting worse.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:37.860
What?

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:41.860
And I now see what it is 
that I must truly treasure.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.590
I can see everything

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.590
without wearing these.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:48.870
Come on...

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.520
That was harsh.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.970
Those glasses were a present.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.790
I'm still wearing...

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:00.790
...the glasses you and everyone else gave me.

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:04.640
I'm wearing the wonderful glasses 
which let me see your souls...

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.800
...on the inside.

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:10.300
Thank you, Gin-san, 
Shinpachi-kun, Kagura-chan.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:11.560
Who are you again?

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.810
You just had to turn me 
into the butt of a joke!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:19.810
I promise to treasure 
the glasses you gave me.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.550
What difference will a 
new pair of glasses make?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.530
You don't need glasses to see...

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.100
...that imminent death approaches.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.330
With the Punishers on the case,

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:34.330
your death is assured!

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:49.970
I-Impossible!

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.600
She's shooting beams from her glasses!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:58.760
Stand firm!

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.280
Attack her glasses from behind!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.520
Aim for her glasses!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:05.600
Three enemies approaching at 
seven meters from the left rear.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:09.070
Power levels are 120, 98, 111.

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:10.660
They will attack after the 
scene change. Prepare yourself.

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:17.190
I can see! I can see! I can see!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.510
I feel like my entire 
body is wearing glasses!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.290
I can see everything!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:21.950
Go, Sa-chan!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.290
Show them the power of a glasses girl!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.300
The power of the Oniwaban!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.300
The power of Sa-chan the Assassin!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.800
Give it to them!

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:50.530
<b>Kill</b>

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.210
The Glasses School of Ninjutsu!

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.600
Ultimate technique!

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.350
Take this!

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:19.060
Flight of the Hundred Glasses!

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:38.580
I-Impressive, Ayame Sarutobi...

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:43.520
You were able to accurately 
place glasses of the

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:47.590
wrong prescription on every single Punisher.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.690
Y-You are Edo's greatest glasses gi--

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.310
Assassin...

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.750
You did it!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.100
Way to go, Sa-chan!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:02.490
You've finally mastered the

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.430
ultimate technique of the Glasses School.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.840
What is this Glasses School?

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:06.910
I'm the only one who doesn't know it?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.110
You've all heard of it?

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:11.110
You can tell that those glasses 
were made by old Gengai.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:12.490
They're not bad.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:14.000
Are those even glasses?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.350
Wouldn't they be considered a weapon?

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.590
I should ask him to make me a pair of glasses

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.370
that can see through clothes 
and remove mosaic censors.

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:23.120
Oh, could you ask him to make two pairs?

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:24.910
Thank you.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.520
I couldn't have done it 
without everybody's help.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.370
Hey, could you not look in this direction?

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.890
I'm scared that you'll start shooting beams.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.100
It's a marvel.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:34.840
The world looks so beautiful 
through these glasses.

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.640
Take Zenzo's drab house.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.180
It looks so flashy that it's almost on fire.

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:41.590
It really is on fire!

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:42.870
You're shooting beams!

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:43.920
The hell are you doing?!

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:46.360
It must be because these glasses 
were a present from all of you.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.560
How wonderful.

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:49.110
I'm going to treasure them.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.220
Thank you so much!

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:53.240
I love you, Gin-san!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.050
Wait!

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:57.030
Don't walk around my home 
with those glasses on!

00:21:57.530 --> 00:21:58.800
Gin-san,

00:21:58.800 --> 00:21:59.990
it seems that glasses

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:01.240
aren't meant to be given as a present,

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.700
even from loved ones.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:03.490
Hmm?

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:04.890
Why's that?

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:07.480
Because you can't regift them.

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:10.040
Clever, but it rubbed me the wrong way.

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.740
Hey, Kagura-kun.

00:22:11.740 --> 00:22:14.030
How about a shot of beams for Shinpachi?

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:49.540
<b>Look forward to next time.</b>
